    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 4,
    "summary": "Nephite dissenters and the Lamanites join forces and take the land of Zarahemla—The Nephites’ defeats come because of their wickedness—The Church dwindles, and the people become weak like the Lamanites. About 38–30 B.C.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
