      {
        "text": "And in the fifty and seventh year they did come down against the Nephites to battle, and they did commence the work of death; yea, insomuch that in the fifty and eighth year of the reign of the judges they succeeded in obtaining possession of the land of Zarahemla; yea, and also all the lands, even unto the land which was near the land Bountiful.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 229,
            "end": 239,
            "text": "Hel. 5:16, 52."
