      },
      {
        "text": "And the Nephites and the armies of Moronihah were driven even into the land of Bountiful;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 4:6",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 4,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And there they did fortify against the Lamanites, from the west sea, even unto the east; it being a day’s journey for a Nephite, on the line which they had fortified and stationed their armies to defend their north country.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 100,
            "end": 105,
            "text": "Alma 22:32."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
