        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 4:8",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 4,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass in the sixtieth year of the reign of the judges, Moronihah did succeed with his armies in obtaining many parts of the land; yea, they regained many cities which had fallen into the hands of the Lamanites.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 4:9",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 4,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass in the sixty and first year of the reign of the judges they succeeded in regaining even the half of all their possessions.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 4:10",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 4,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Now this great loss of the Nephites, and the great slaughter which was among them, would not have happened had it not been for their wickedness and their abomination which was among them; yea, and it was among those also who professed to belong to the church of God.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 83,
            "end": 92,
            "text": "D&C 82:10."
          },
          {
            "start": 133,
            "end": 143,
