        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 4,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And because of this their great wickedness, and their boastings in their own strength, they were left in their own strength; therefore they did not prosper, but were afflicted and smitten, and driven before the Lamanites, until they had lost possession of almost all their lands.",
        "footNotes": [
