        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 4,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "For when Moronihah saw that they did repent he did venture to lead them forth from place to place, and from city to city, even until they had regained the one-half of their property and the one-half of all their lands.",
        "footNotes": [
